  "catalyst": {
    "name": "Focused Fury, Jolting Feedback, Divinity Catalyst",
    "description": "Scoring 18 hits within 3 seconds of each causes the next hit to apply Jolt. Being Amplified decreases the number of hits required to 13.\nScoring 68 Precision Hits grants 25% increased damage for 11 seconds. Stowing or Reloading the weapon resets the Precision Hit counter.\nBuff remains active while stowed.",
